**Making Drums**

The weather has been perfect for drying this cow skin that we got from a home butcher in Conondale. In the past we have sourced our skins from Charlyville, nearly 1000kms away, once dried and delivered. Now we have travelled less that 100kms away round trip!  We have used an old trampoline, some rope and pure sunlight for the process....no chemicals needed!  Lots of workshop hours ahead and beautiful new drums to come!

